ndroid CVE-2026-58882 的 PoC，可通过特制 WAP Push 短信远程触发拒绝服务，导致通话中断。","source",{"_54":181,"_182":183},"publishedAt","selected",true,"BleepingComputer","firstParty",false,"vwazprhy9sym8n3jfpzyapz5g","独立研究员 Mark Blaszczyk 披露 Android 的 SMS of Death 漏洞 CVE-2026-58882，攻击者仅需发送一条特制 WAP Push 消息即可零点击触发崩溃，阻断电话及紧急呼叫。",{"_54":187,"_182":183},"Security Affairs",{"_189":190,"_13":191,"_20":21,"_17":18,"_192":193},"factId","fafTcIRBwfko","公开Android短信远程崩溃漏洞利用","representative",{"_172":184,"_13":31,"_28":185,"_176":194,"_178":23,"_179":180},{"_54":187,"_182":183},"participants48h","newParticipants6h",0,"recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",{"_202":203,"_204":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
